'''Revolution''' [[File:Icon tab revo.png|16x16px]] is the first and starting stage of the game.

=='''Circles'''==
'''Circles''', also known as '''Colors''', are the main Score (ⵙ) production units for the game.

Various skins for the Circles can be purchased in the [[Soul Shop]].

Each time a Circle finishes a lap, also known as a Revolution, it will produce Score (equal to [[Revolution#Income_Calculation|Score income]]), and the number (multiplier/mult) at the top of the screen of the same color will increase (equal to the Circle's mult gain).

Circles have levels which are bought with Score. When a Circle's level is increased, the time it takes to complete a revolution will decrease, also known as its laps per second (laps/s).

Each Circle has its own base lap speed, which becomes slower the farther it is from Red (see table below for more details).

There are 10 Circles in total and the player start with the {{Keyword|red|Red}} Circle unlocked (and 5 levels of {{Keyword|red|Red}}). Other Circles are unlocked after buying 5 levels of the previous Circle, in the order shown below:

 {{Keyword|red|Red}} → {{Keyword|orange|Orange}} → {{Keyword|yellow|Yellow}} → {{Keyword|green|Green}} → {{Keyword|turquoise|Turquoise}} → {{Keyword|cyan|Cyan}} → {{Keyword|blue|Blue}} → {{Keyword|purple|Purple}} → {{Keyword|pink|Pink}} → White

