It's best to ascend when a circle hits Max Level to maximize growth. However, waiting until one or two additional circles are ready to ascend helps maintain speed.

Although Revolution gain slows after ascension, level 10 onwards significantly increases growth.

Ascension power is 10x by default, but can be improved later on with future upgrades.

=='''Prestige'''==
Prestige is unlocked when the score reaches 1e10 (10B). 
Performing a prestige will grant you the P.Exponent and P.Mult displayed on the window, but in exchange, '''all progress up to this point (accumulated score, circle upgrades & ascensions) will be reset.'''
* '''P.Mult''' - Prestige Multiplier. Considered as a static multiplier calculated like colored circles' mults (shown as the dull grey value after White)
* '''P.Exponent''' - Prestige Exponent. Adds additional logarithmic scaling to the income. Affects common exponent.
====Income Calculation with Prestige:====
 '''ⵙ/second''' = ⵙ/Revolution * [Sum of all colors' Revolutions/second]
 '''ⵙ/Revolution''' = ( [Product of all colors' Mults] * P.Mult ) ^ P.Exponent

During initial runs, it is recommended to achieve at least a x10 P.Mult before prestiging.

After prestiging, you will start fresh but with an increased income boost. To access the Prestige Window again, you must reach the point where you previously prestiged.<br> 
Aim to prestige with at least one or two orders of magnitude; for example, starting with x10 P.Mult, then x1000, and so forth.

=='''Promotions'''==
Promotion becomes available for the first time when P.Mult exceeds x1000 (either on-hand or upcoming P.Mult). It resets all progress up to this point to level up '''one''' of the four promotion boosts:

# '''Mult Gain Mult''': Multiplies your circles' Mult Gain.
# '''Laps Speed Mult''': Multiplies your circles' laps per second.
# '''Ascension Power''': Enhances your circles' Asc. Power.
# '''Promotion Power''': Boosts the effectiveness of the first three promotions.

You gain more promotion experience based on your P.Mult value (on-hand or upcoming). You cannot select a promotion boost that you cannot gain a level for.

The suggested order for early game promotions is:

* promotion 1 → promotion 2 → promotion 3 → promotion 4 → repeat

* Mult Gain Mult → Laps Speed Mult → Ascension Power → Promotion Power → repeat.
It is advisable to wait until achieving at least x6 Mult Gain Mult on the first promotion before performing it.

