==Common Exponent==
Common exponent is applied last right before your final score is given, and is thus extremely powerful. You should prioritize it most of the time.

== Soul shop bonuses ==
Soul shop lets you buy permanent multipliers for souls. The formula including these bonuses would look like this:
 '''Income Calculation''' = (Income per Revolution * (1 + (Soul-Income Boost))) * [Sum of all colors' Revolutions/second]
 '''Income per Revolution''' = Base Revolution Mult ^ Common Exponent
 '''Base Revolution Mult''' = 
   [Product of all Color Mults] 
 * Prestige Mult 
 * (1 + Soul Shop P.Mult)
 * (1 + Soul Shop Multiplier) 
 * (1 + Soul Shop Income Mult)
<nowiki>*</nowiki>Prestige exponent and Revolutions per second include their respective shop bonuses in their own formulae.

